{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>He made known</b> — future tense in place of past, like the pattern of יעשו עגל בחורב. And the ways are those mentioned in the verse ויעבור ה' על פניו." "<b>To the children of Israel, His mighty deeds</b> — by the hand of Moses."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 103, :notes {0 "Resolved הדרכים as 'the ways'; the construct chain הנזכרים בפסוק governs the cited verse."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:59.188584021Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}